# Page pipeline working directory. Local scratch, with one exception: the
# sources ledger is the audit trail for every date on /seasonable — what was
# checked, what was rejected and why. Losing it means re-walking 254
# disciplinari to find out which ones state no harvest date.
# Directory patterns stop git descending, hence the file-level form.
.pipeline/*
!.pipeline/seasonable/
.pipeline/seasonable/*
!.pipeline/seasonable/sources-ledger.md

# Claude Code project config. Local, except the skills: they are project
# convention rather than machine state, and seasonable-sourcing carries the
# rules the dataset's provenance depends on.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
